# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The eastern loop

step Grimtotem camp
  tip From Thalanaar ride west along the road to the Grimtotem camp north of it. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal and at least six of them alive.
  accept 2969                         -- Kindal Moonweaver
  complete 2969
  turnin 2969
  accept 2970                         -- Jer'kai Moonweaver

